WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.746 --> 00:00:13.447
fine day, a young farm girl walked to the market.

2
00:00:14.868 --> 00:00:16.208
Her name was Molly.

3
00:00:18.129 --> 00:00:20.950
On her head, she carried a pail of milk.

4
00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:25.191
"I am so excited!

5
00:00:27.111 --> 00:00:29.092
The market has so much to see!

6
00:00:31.164 --> 00:00:34.026
After I sell my milk, what should I buy?"

7
00:00:34.627 --> 00:00:35.287
she wondered.

8
00:00:35.307 --> 00:00:39.711
"Hmm! Let me think!"

9
00:00:43.994 --> 00:00:46.496
But Molly had only one pail of milk.

10
00:00:48.398 --> 00:00:50.680
She could not sell it for a lot of money.

11
00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:55.604
"I will buy one hen," she decided.

12
00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:02.901
"What would I do with just one hen?

13
00:01:04.882 --> 00:01:06.743
One hen would lay many eggs.

14
00:01:09.204 --> 00:01:10.545
Then the eggs would hatch.

15
00:01:14.667 --> 00:01:16.648
What would I do with all the chicks?

16
00:01:21.271 --> 00:01:22.652
I would feed the chicks.

17
00:01:24.873 --> 00:01:26.794
They would grow large and healthy.

18
00:01:28.495 --> 00:01:30.496
Then they would lay more eggs.

19
00:01:31.884 --> 00:01:35.086
The eggs would hatch, and I would have more chicks!

20
00:01:41.949 --> 00:01:42.650
Oh yes!

21
00:01:43.230 --> 00:01:45.812
Then I would sell many eggs and chicks.

22
00:01:47.572 --> 00:01:50.334
People would come from all around to buy them.

23
00:01:52.235 --> 00:01:53.256
I would be rich!"

24
00:01:53.836 --> 00:01:54.856
Molly smiled.

25
00:01:54.876 --> 00:02:03.165
"I would buy beautiful clothes, golden pins for my hair, and shiny shoes.

26
00:02:06.026 --> 00:02:10.069
I would be the richest and most famous person in the village!

27
00:02:17.813 --> 00:02:20.894
One day, I would be invited to the palace.

28
00:02:22.355 --> 00:02:23.856
Everyone would envy me!

29
00:02:26.017 --> 00:02:27.918
I would meet a handsome prince.

30
00:02:30.139 --> 00:02:32.140
The prince would bow to me.

31
00:02:33.761 --> 00:02:35.361
And I would bow to him.

32
00:02:35.381 --> 00:02:47.005
I would say, 'Your Majesty,' and bow like this When Molly bowed, the pail fell from her head.

33
00:02:51.006 --> 00:02:52.827
milk spilled everywhere.

34
00:02:53.967 --> 00:02:56.048
Molly cried and cried.

35
00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:03.862
The milk was gone.

36
00:03:04.923 --> 00:03:07.326
And Molly's dreams were gone too.
